{"ref":"BDB, עֹ֫פֶר","hw":"עֹ֫פֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֹ֫פֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.5\">Ct 4:5</a></sup> <strong>young hart, stag</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ הָאַיָּלִים</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">צְבִי</span>) <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:9\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.9\">Ct 2:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:17\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.14\">8:14</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֳפָרִים תְּאוֹמֵי צְבִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.5\">4:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.4\">7:4</a> (all in sim.).","next":"BDB, עֵ֫פֶר","prev":"BDB, עפר²"}